flowchart TD
  UX_PUBLIC["UX_PUBLIC Public beginner content"] -->|Continue your journey| UX_AUTH["UX_AUTH Login / Register / Verify"]
  UX_AUTH --> UX_ROLE{"UX_ROLE Server-derived role landing"}
  UX_ROLE -->|user| UX_MY_COURSE["UX_MY_COURSE My Course"]
  UX_ROLE -->|admin or master_admin| UX_ADMIN_HOME["UX_ADMIN_HOME Admin Dashboard"]
  UX_ROLE -->|invalid or unavailable| UX_DENIED["UX_DENIED Safe denied state"]
  subgraph LEARNER["Localized learner experience"]
    UX_MY_COURSE -->|none| UX_COURSE_EMPTY["UX_COURSE_EMPTY Explicit empty state"]
    UX_MY_COURSE -->|Start / Continue / Open| UX_COURSE["UX_COURSE Course Overview"]
    UX_MY_COURSE -->|Resume| UX_RESUME["UX_RESUME First incomplete Required item"]
    UX_MY_COURSE --> UX_UTILITIES["UX_UTILITIES Profile / Progress / Notifications / Help"]
    UX_UTILITIES -->|change preferred language| UX_LANGUAGE["UX_LANGUAGE Preference update outside course"]
    UX_LANGUAGE --> UX_MY_COURSE
    UX_COURSE -->|Start Course| UX_COURSE_STARTED["UX_COURSE_STARTED Open first Available lesson"]
    UX_COURSE -->|locked| UX_LOCKED["UX_LOCKED Non-clickable prerequisite explanation"]
    UX_COURSE -->|open permitted| UX_LESSON["UX_LESSON Lesson Overview"]
    UX_COURSE_STARTED --> UX_LESSON
    UX_LESSON -->|Start Lesson and remain| UX_LESSON_ACTIVE["UX_LESSON_ACTIVE All items available"]
    UX_LESSON -->|already started or completed| UX_LESSON_ACTIVE
    UX_LESSON_ACTIVE --> UX_TUTORIAL["UX_TUTORIAL Tutorial / Topic"]
    UX_LESSON_ACTIVE --> UX_MEDITATION["UX_MEDITATION Guided Meditation"]
    UX_LESSON_ACTIVE --> UX_QUIZ["UX_QUIZ Full randomized quiz attempt"]
    UX_TUTORIAL -->|end plus Complete Tutorial| UX_ITEM_COMPLETE["UX_ITEM_COMPLETE Factual completion"]
    UX_MEDITATION -->|configured end| UX_ITEM_COMPLETE
    UX_QUIZ -->|submit| UX_QUIZ_RESULT["UX_QUIZ_RESULT Score, policy, cycle history"]
    UX_QUIZ_RESULT -->|pass| UX_ITEM_COMPLETE
    UX_QUIZ_RESULT -->|fail and attempts remain| UX_QUIZ
    UX_QUIZ_RESULT -->|timed wait| UX_WAIT_TIMED["UX_WAIT_TIMED Eligibility time"]
    UX_QUIZ_RESULT -->|administrator reset| UX_WAIT_ADMIN["UX_WAIT_ADMIN Await reset"]
    UX_WAIT_TIMED -->|eligible| UX_QUIZ
    UX_ITEM_COMPLETE --> UX_REQUIREMENTS{"UX_REQUIREMENTS All Required items complete?"}
    UX_REQUIREMENTS -->|no| UX_LESSON_ACTIVE
    UX_REQUIREMENTS -->|yes| UX_LESSON_COMPLETE["UX_LESSON_COMPLETE Optional items remain"]
    UX_LESSON_COMPLETE --> UX_COURSE_COMPLETE{"UX_COURSE_COMPLETE All required lessons complete?"}
    UX_COURSE_COMPLETE -->|no and unlock| UX_COURSE
    UX_COURSE_COMPLETE -->|yes| UX_REVIEW["UX_REVIEW Course remains reviewable"]
    UX_RESUME --> UX_TUTORIAL
    UX_RESUME --> UX_MEDITATION
    UX_RESUME --> UX_QUIZ
  end
  subgraph ADMIN["English administration"]
    UX_ADMIN_HOME --> UX_ADMIN_COURSES["UX_ADMIN_COURSES Course list / details"]
    UX_ADMIN_COURSES --> UX_ADMIN_EDITOR["UX_ADMIN_EDITOR Course / lesson / item / quiz editors"]
    UX_ADMIN_EDITOR -->|Save Draft| UX_ADMIN_EDITOR
    UX_ADMIN_EDITOR --> UX_GOVERNANCE["UX_GOVERNANCE Reviews and publication eligibility"]
    UX_GOVERNANCE -->|Preview| UX_PREVIEW["UX_PREVIEW No impersonation or progress"]
    UX_GOVERNANCE -->|Publish / unpublish / archive| UX_ADMIN_COURSES
    UX_ADMIN_HOME --> UX_ADMIN_LEARNERS["UX_ADMIN_LEARNERS Learner search and factual detail"]
    UX_ADMIN_LEARNERS --> UX_LEARNER_DETAIL["UX_LEARNER_DETAIL Progress and attempt history"]
    UX_LEARNER_DETAIL --> UX_RESET_PREVIEW["UX_RESET_PREVIEW Dependency impact before confirm"]
    UX_RESET_PREVIEW -->|cancel| UX_LEARNER_DETAIL
    UX_RESET_PREVIEW -->|confirm| UX_RESET_RESULT["UX_RESET_RESULT History preserved and learner notified"]
    UX_RESET_RESULT --> UX_LEARNER_DETAIL
    UX_ADMIN_HOME --> UX_REPORTS["UX_REPORTS Factual progress and activity"]
    UX_ADMIN_HOME -->|master_admin only| UX_ADMIN_MGMT["UX_ADMIN_MGMT Invite / grant / revoke admin"]
    UX_ADMIN_HOME -->|My Course| UX_MY_COURSE
  end
  UX_ADMIN_MGMT -->|admin direct access| UX_DENIED
  UX_PUBLIC -->|service conflict| UX_UNAVAILABLE["UX_UNAVAILABLE Safe recovery state"]
